    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn Japanese with a  fun way to fixate the Hiragana and Katakana syllabaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a Ninja and your mission is to strike the opposing Ninja carrying the correct banner. Can you master all three paths ? Once you lock in your answer, don't forget to use your Ninja invisibility to avoid striking the wrong Ninja!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Includes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Three game modes: Hiragana, Katakana and Hiragana &amp; Katakana</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ninja Invisibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 200 syllables for you to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A streak of 10 correct answers will earn you another life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reinvigorate your Japanese learning today and become the true Hiragana Katakana Ninja!</p>",
